// The prefix integer of HTTP header compression, RFC 7541 §5.1:
// https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7541#section-5.1
//
// A value in the low N bits of an octet, continuing into further octets when it does not
// fit, with the bits above the prefix left to whatever representation is using it.
//
// RFC 9204 §4.1.1 gives QPACK the same encoding, so HTTP/2's header compression and
// HTTP/3's read one implementation.
